{"id":"e9bbbe4420f54ce9","group":"91","path":"91/91-cor-gap-implies-stable.md","title":"极小固定点确定性蕴含稳定","display":"cor-gap-implies-stable — 极小固定点确定性蕴含稳定","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-cor-gap-implies-stable","aliases":["91-cor-gap-implies-stable","91-cor-gap-stability","91-cor-gap-sentence-property"],"display":"cor-gap-implies-stable — 极小固定点确定性蕴含稳定","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-value-gap]]","[[91-df-stable-sentence]]","[[91-lem-gap-glut-duality]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-cor-gap-implies-stable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-cor-gap-implies-stable</span><span>91-cor-gap-stability</span><span>91-cor-gap-sentence-property</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-gap-implies-stable — 极小固定点确定性蕴含稳定"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8747011468390705\" href=\"?note=8747011468390705\" title=\"91-df-truth-value-gap\">91-df-truth-value-gap</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3a19d5715745463a\" href=\"?note=3a19d5715745463a\" title=\"91-df-stable-sentence\">91-df-stable-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0471e9434da6820e\" href=\"?note=0471e9434da6820e\" title=\"91-lem-gap-glut-duality\">91-lem-gap-glut-duality</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> (句子)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_{\\min}\">\\(\\Gamma_{\\min}\\)</span> (最小固定点)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\">\\(\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\)</span> (一致固定点类)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Stable}(\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{Stable}(\\varphi)\\)</span> (所有一致固定点同值的稳定性谓词)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_\\Gamma:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\n\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}\">\\(v_\\Gamma:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\n\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}\\)</span> (固定点诱导的强 Kleene 赋值)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MinFix}_c(\\Gamma_{\\min},J)\\coloneqq\n\\Gamma_{\\min}\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\land\n\\forall\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\,\n(\\Gamma_{\\min}\\subseteq\\Gamma)\">\\(\\operatorname{MinFix}_c(\\Gamma_{\\min},J)\\coloneqq\n\\Gamma_{\\min}\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\land\n\\forall\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\,\n(\\Gamma_{\\min}\\subseteq\\Gamma)\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}gap\\text{-}implies\\text{-}stable}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{MinFix}_c(\\Gamma_{\\min},J)\n\\to\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in\\Gamma_{\\min}\n&amp;\\to\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Stable}(\\varphi)\n\\land\n\\forall\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\,\nv_\\Gamma(\\varphi)=\\mathbf t\n\\right],\\\\\n\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\in\\Gamma_{\\min}\n&amp;\\to\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Stable}(\\varphi)\n\\land\n\\forall\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\,\nv_\\Gamma(\\varphi)=\\mathbf f\n\\right].\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}gap\\text{-}implies\\text{-}stable}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{MinFix}_c(\\Gamma_{\\min},J)\n\\to\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in\\Gamma_{\\min}\n&amp;\\to\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Stable}(\\varphi)\n\\land\n\\forall\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\,\nv_\\Gamma(\\varphi)=\\mathbf t\n\\right],\\\\\n\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\in\\Gamma_{\\min}\n&amp;\\to\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Stable}(\\varphi)\n\\land\n\\forall\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\,\nv_\\Gamma(\\varphi)=\\mathbf f\n\\right].\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>推论的含义：\n极小固定点中已经取得的真、假编码因极小性而出现在所有一致固定点中，\n固定点条件再把这些编码分别读成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf t\">\\(\\mathbf t\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf f\">\\(\\mathbf f\\)</span>。\n反过来，极小固定点中的间隙不必稳定为间隙。</p>\n<p>真理陈述者在极小固定点中是间隙，却可在其他一致固定点中取真或假，\n因此直接构成原命题的反例。说谎者的稳定间隙需要利用其特殊对角式另证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-value-gap","status":"resolved","id":"8747011468390705","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-value-gap]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-stable-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"3a19d5715745463a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-stable-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-lem-gap-glut-duality","status":"resolved","id":"0471e9434da6820e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-lem-gap-glut-duality]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_{\\min}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Stable}(\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"v_\\Gamma:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\n\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MinFix}_c(\\Gamma_{\\min},J)\\coloneqq\n\\Gamma_{\\min}\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\land\n\\forall\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\,\n(\\Gamma_{\\min}\\subseteq\\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}gap\\text{-}implies\\text{-}stable}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{MinFix}_c(\\Gamma_{\\min},J)\n\\to\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in\\Gamma_{\\min}\n&\\to\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Stable}(\\varphi)\n\\land\n\\forall\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\,\nv_\\Gamma(\\varphi)=\\mathbf t\n\\right],\\\\\n\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\in\\Gamma_{\\min}\n&\\to\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Stable}(\\varphi)\n\\land\n\\forall\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\,\nv_\\Gamma(\\varphi)=\\mathbf f\n\\right].\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf t","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf f","display":false}],"bytes":1980,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["8747011468390705","3a19d5715745463a","0471e9434da6820e"]}